# Odoo Upgrade Rule

## Migration paths (16–19 focus)
- 16 → 17: remove `attrs`/`states`; inline modifiers; prefer `<list>` / `list,form`; `@api.model_create_multi`; `SQL()` available
- 17 → 18: `_check_company_auto`; `check_company=True`; type hints recommended
- 18 → 19: type hints / `SQL()` strongly recommended (not mandatory for all custom modules); OWL 3.x stricter props
- Across 16–19: keep `ir.rule` domains on `company_ids` (do not “migrate” to `allowed_company_ids`)

## Workflow
1. State source and target version (pin mcp-code `version` to v16|v17|v18|v19)
2. Identify impacted modules; preserve external IDs and semantics
3. Apply incremental patches
4. Verify with `odoo-codemode` (`codemode_execute` / `odoo.compact.compare_versions`) when unsure
5. Offline stable syntax: `skills/odoo-invariants.md`
